            "review_title": "Review at Azumaya Dining",
            "review_text": "Ha Ng.\nHanoi, Vietnam47 contributions\n0\nWorst Japanese food experience\nAug 2018 • Friends\nI already lost my expectation upon entering, since the staff were so amateurish (chattering very loud and didn't really attend to guests). But I was wrong. The food was bad beyond imagination. I had several yakitori types, karaage and gyoza, but none were average. Yakitori was oily, karaage was so hard and dry (seriously KFC would be better), gyoza was burnt, and there was no flavor in anything.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 30, 2018",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
